This plugin bundles skills adapted from several upstream projects. Each retains
its own license; the repository-root NOTICE file carries the full attribution and
third-party license text. Sources include:

- ag-kit (https://github.com/vudovn/ag-kit), Copyright (c) 2026 VUDOVN, MIT.
- antigravity-marketing (https://github.com/nguyenphp/antigravity-marketing),
  Copyright (c) NguyenPHP, MIT.
- ClaudeKit (https://github.com/mrgoonie/claudekit-skills), MIT — source of the
  `brand` and `banner-design` skills.
- MiniMax-AI/skills (https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/skills), Copyright (c) 2026
  MiniMax, MIT — source of the `minimax-pdf` skill.
- Remotion Dev Skills (https://github.com/remotion-dev/skills) — source of
  `remotion-best-practices`, `video-automation`, `tutorial-video-expert`.
- vibeship-spawner-skills, Apache License 2.0 — source of the
  `viral-generator-builder` skill (see that skill's LICENSE for the full text).
- ai-marketing-claude (https://github.com/zubair-trabzada/ai-marketing-claude),
  Copyright (c) 2026 Zubair Trabzada, MIT — source of the `client-proposal` skill.
- agentkits-marketing (https://github.com/aitytech/agentkits-marketing),
  Copyright (c) AityTech, MIT — source of the `schema-markup`, `form-cro`,
  `free-tool-strategy`, `copy-editing`, and `email-sequence` skills.

See the NOTICE file at the repository root for the full third-party license text.
